OL,3,GNEWSACouncil wins 'Downton Shabby' High
OL,4,ACourt case
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn American filmmaker has lost his High
OL,7,FCourt bid to take ownership of Hopwood
OL,8,FHall in Middleton, Rochdale, for #1.
OL,10,FHopwood DePree, who claims ancestral
OL,11,Flinks to the Grade II-listed hall, said
OL,12,Fhe was "incredibly disappointed" after
OL,13,Fa judge ruled against him.
OL,15,FHe argued a 2017 agreement with
OL,16,FRochdale Council gave him the option to
OL,17,Fbuy the property after securing
OL,18,Fplanning permission to restore and
OL,19,Fredevelop it.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
